---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/HeroSection.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
---

<PageLayout>
  <HeroSection
    backgroundImage="/images/hero/IMG_3280.png"
    title="Chuan Law"
    subtitle="Data Engineer | Masters of Artificial Intelligence"
    location="Wellington, New Zealand"
    profileImage="/images/profile/profile_picture.jpg"
  />

  <div class="content">
    <section class="section">
      <h3 class="section-heading">About Me</h3>
      <p>
        Hi there and welcome to my little corner of the internet!
      </p>
      <p>
        I am a New Zealand based Data Engineer working at
        <a href="https://www.trademe.co.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trade Me</a>
        and a graduate of the
        <a href="https://www.wgtn.ac.nz/explore/postgraduate-programmes/master-of-artificial-intelligence/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Master of Artificial Intelligence</a>
        program at Victoria University of Wellington. My thesis research involved using an OpenAI inspired
        <a href="https://openai.com/index/evolution-strategies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">evolutionary reinforcement learning</a>
        algorithm to optimize cost saving in geographically distributed cloud systems.
        You can find the paper and project on
        <a href="https://github.com/cllaw/AIML589-RL-DDMWS/blob/master/Chuan-Law-MAI-Thesis-2024.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.</a>
      </p>
      <p>This site is also where I share snapshots I've taken over the years and the occasional thought or reflection.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Skills</h3>
      <ul class="skills-grid">
        <li>
          <img src="https://icongr.am/devicon/python-original.svg?size=100" alt="Python" />
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Amazon_Web_Services_Logo.svg" alt="AWS" style="height: 50px" />
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/googlecloud/googlecloud-original-wordmark.svg" alt="Google Cloud" style="height: 100px" />
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/terraform/terraform-original-wordmark.svg" alt="Terraform" style="height: 75px" />
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/Snowflake_Logo.svg" alt="Snowflake" style="height: 50px" />
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="https://logowik.com/content/uploads/images/dbt5596.jpg" alt="DBT" style="height: 75px" />
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        I am an experienced cloud engineer well versed in 3 major public cloud offerings of AWS, GCP and Azure.
        I have Terraform experience building production capable infrastructure using all three and I am cloud certified in GCP and Azure.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a data engineer, I am proficient with SQL and Snowflake. I have recently been upskilling in the analytics space with the use of DBT.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Projects</h3>
      <p>
        Across my 3 years of study, I have been involved in some interesting projects. In 2018 I took one my favourite
        papers, Humans and Computer Interaction (COSC368). This was a very design heavy and UI/UX focused course. Our team built
        a prototype of an idealised car park finder application for the university and the clickable product is available
        <a href="https://invis.io/ZGOASCK4CNM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here.</a>
      </p>
      <p>This is just one of my favourites from 2018. Check out my projects page to see all of my featured work!</p>
      <a href="/projects" class="btn">View my projects</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Blog</h3>
      <p>
        Whenever I travel (or just everyday when I see something nice) I like to take photos. It's nice just writing
        sometimes and its even nicer to remember the places you've visited. My blog is just a collection of some of my
        favourite photos and what was on my mind when taking them.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog" class="btn">View my blog</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section connect">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Connect with me!</h3>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <SocialLinks />
      <div class="divider"></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 2rem 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .section p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .skills-grid li {
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .skills-grid li:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .skills-grid img {
    max-height: 60px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .connect {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .divider {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-primary);
    width: 50%;
    margin: 1rem auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .content {
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .skills-grid img {
      max-height: 45px;
    }
  }
</style>
